{"seq":16,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-route-hook-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T20:37:47.022Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"af498f2f13c782e3e566d85e65b177563d44fd3cc957de65c6ee72990188640c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"Here are the Quarrendon Freight Lines (QFL) ticket numbers I found in Moss's digests:\n\n1. **#4419**: Source is Moss's undated North cheat sheet (`teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md`). It says Thea Ramaswell logged #4419 for gatehouse barcode scanners failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. The same note says it was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing.\n2. **#PD-4492**: Source is Moss's \"Sunday prep for Ruth\" from 5 Oct 2025 (`teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md`). Thea submitted it on 4 Oct 2025 for gatehouse kiosk SMS bay assignments not reaching drivers at the Eau Claire yard (Doors 14–18). A patch went in that evening, and the 04:00 shift cleared on 5 Oct. The same note has an action to review it before the 14 Oct maintenance window.\n\nTwo things to be aware of:\n\n- Marcus Lindqvist's Q2 expansion wrap (14 Jul 2025, `members/marcus-lindqvist/notes/`) also cites **#4419**, but describes it as \"Gate 3 printer lag\" rather than the Door 14 scanner issue. That note isn't Moss's, so I've listed it only as a conflict. Someone should confirm which description is right before the weekly notes go out.\n- I left out #4409 and #4412. They appear in Moss's Central handoffs digest, but they belong to a Central account (Pree's dealer account, Salina North yard), not QFL.\n\nI also checked the GBrain index first. It's running keyword-only, so it may miss some notes. I verified the ticket references against the files directly. I haven't written anything to the weekly notes yet. If you want, I can post this list there or send it to Ruth."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
